{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfQ1iQDMTRjZazBuoAzjB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass and no dependencies were added. Here's the complete implementation summary:\n\n## Changed Files\n\n**API Package**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiExceptions.kt` - Added UnprocessableEntityException for 422 responses\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt` - Added CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND error code\n\n**Order Feature**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/Order.kt` - Added quantity field, Fulfilment data class with allocated/delivered/status, FulfilmentStatus enum, UpdateOrderQuantityRequest\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderRepository.kt` - Added pagination methods (findAll with limit/offset) and count()\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderController.kt` - Complete rewrite to support: quantity validation, customer existence check (HTTP 422), fulfilment computation, PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity, pagination with X-Total-Count header, fulfilment filter\n\n**Shipment Feature**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/Shipment.kt` - Added quantity