ults to 1, validates positive integer |\n| PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity | Implemented with validation and allocation check |\n| POST /shipments quantity | Defaults to 1, validates positive integer |\n| POST /shipments allocation check | HTTP 409 if exceeds order quantity |\n| Shipment transitions | confirm (CREATED→CONFIRMED), deliver (CONFIRMED→DELIVERED), cancel (CREATED→CANCELLED) |\n| Cancelled shipment releases quantity | Implemented - non-CANCELLED filter excludes them |\n| GET /customers pagination | Implemented with X-Total-Count |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} error envelope | Returns 404 through error envelope |\n| GET /shipments pagination | Implemented with X-Total-Count |\n\n## Tests\n\nAll 36 tests pass covering:\n- Baseline order, shipment, customer operations\n- Partial fulfillment: quantities, allocation, status transitions\n- Cancelled shipments releasing quantity\n- Order quantity amendment\n- Fulfillment filter\n- Shipment state transitions (confirm, deliver, cancel)\n- Pagination and X-Total-Count headers\n- Customer validation\n- Error cases with proper HTTP status codes and error envelopes\n\n## Verification\n\nRunning `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` produces:\n```\nTests run: 36, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\nBUILD SUCCESS\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":244,"cache_read_input_tokens":62290,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":244,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TLsqsYcj6uzYXhKHbj78Vh","session_id":"42799910-08be-447c-8309-9c80ab7c85db","uuid":"d54b1e9d-bde7-455a-acd0-d6f2fbd78176","timestamp":"2026-09-25T10:38:39.620Z","request_id":"req_011CfQ1iPnoaqe4ucKb5UyYU","subagent_type":"implementer","task_description":"Implement BE-005 ticket"}
