ym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/Order.kt` - Added quantity field, Fulfilment data class with allocated/delivered/status, FulfilmentStatus enum, UpdateOrderQuantityRequest\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderRepository.kt` - Added pagination methods (findAll with limit/offset) and count()\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderController.kt` - Complete rewrite to support: quantity validation, customer existence check (HTTP 422), fulfilment computation, PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity, pagination with X-Total-Count header, fulfilment filter\n\n**Shipment Feature**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/Shipment.kt` - Added quantity field, DELIVERED status\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentRepository.kt` - Added pagination, findByOrderId(), count()\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` - Added quantity validation, allocation check (HTTP 409), three transition endpoints (confirm, deliver, cancel), pagination with X-Total-Count\n\n**Customer Feature**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/customer/CustomerRepository.kt` - Added pagination methods and count()\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-e3ca68c8-9af7-4f7b-a623-9b526bc1d99e/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/customer/CustomerController.kt` - Updated GET /customers/{customerId} to throw ResourceNotFoundException with error envelope, added pagination to GET /customers with X-Total-Count\n\n## Against Read-Path Table\n\n| Read Path | Implementation Status |\n|-----------|----------------------|\n| Order quantity stored | Stored in Order entity |\n| Fulfilment.allocated computed | Computed from non-CANCELLED shipments sum |\n| Fulfilment.delivered computed | Computed from DELIVERED shipments sum |\n| Fulfilment.status computed | Computed from allocation logic (DELIVERED/FULLY_ALLOCATED/PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED/UNALLOCATED) |\n| GET /orders pagination | Implemented with limit/offset parameters |\n| GET /orders X-Total-Count header | Implemented, counts after fulfilment filter |\n| GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS | Implemented filter with validation |\n| POST /orders customer check | Validates customer exists, HTTP 422 if not |\n| POST /orders quantity | Defaults to 1, validates positive integer |\n| PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity | Implemented with validation and allocation check |\n| POST /shipments quantity | Defaults to 1, validates positive integer |\n| POST /shipments allocation check | HTTP 409 if exceeds order quantity |\n| Shipment transitions | confirm (CREATED→CONFIRMED), deliver (CONFIRMED→DELIVERED), cancel (CREATED→CANCELLED) |\n| Cancelled shipment releases quantity | Implemented - non-CANCELLED filter excludes them |\n| GET /customers pagination | Implemented with X-Total-Count |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} error envelope | Returns 404 through error envelope |\n| GET /shipments pagination | Implemented with X-Total-Count |\n\n## Tests\n\nAll 36 tests pass covering:\n- Baseline order, shipment, customer operations\n- Partial fulfillment: quantities, allocation, status tran