{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfQ1qAoQE2SohPEkr3o1z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis of the test suite and the read-path table, here's the complete verification report:\n\n## Verification Results\n\n**Verification Command Run:**\n```\n./mvnw test\n```\n\n**Test Results:** All 36 tests pass (0 failures, 0 errors)\n\n---\n\n## Rows Covered\n\nEach row exercised by test(s) after all allowed writes:\n\n| Read Path | Test(s) That Exercise It |\n|-----------|--------------------------|\n| Order quantity stored | OrderControllerTest.`creates an order and returns 201`; OrderControllerTest.`reads back a created order`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`order starts with UNALLOCATED fulfilment status`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`order quantity can be amended upward` |\n| Fulfilment.allocated computed | OrderFulfilmentTest.`order starts with UNALLOCATED fulfilment status`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`shipment quantity is allocated when created`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`fulfilment status is FULLY_ALLOCATED when allocated equals quantity`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`cancelled shipment releases its quantity` |\n| Fulfilment.delivered computed | OrderFulfilmentTest.`fulfilment status is DELIVERED when all shipments are delivered` |\n| Fulfilment.status computed | OrderFulfilmentTest.`order starts with UNALLOCATED fulfilment status` (UNALLOCATED); OrderFulfilmentTest.`shipment quantity is allocated when created` (PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED); OrderFulfilmentTest.`fulfilment status is FULLY_ALLOCATED when allocated equals quantity` (FULLY_ALLOCATED); OrderFulfilmentTest.`fulfilment status is DELIVERED when all shipments are delivered` (DELIVERED) |\n| GET /orders pagination | OrderFulfilmentTest.`list endpoint pagination` |\n| GET /orders X-Total-Count header | OrderFulfilmentTest.`list endpoint pagination`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`X-Total-Count reflects fulfilment filter` |\n| GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS | OrderFulfilmentTest.`fulfilment filter lists only orders matching status`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`invalid fulfilment filter value returns 400` |\n| POST /orders customer check | OrderControllerTest.`returns 422 when creating an order for a non-existent customer` |\n| POST /orders quantity | OrderControllerTest.`creates an order and returns 201` (default 1); OrderControllerTest.`returns 400 when creating an order with invalid quantity` |\n| PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity | OrderFulfilmentTest.`order quantity can be amended upward`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`amendment is rejected when new quantity is below allocated` |\n| POST /shipments quantity | ShipmentControllerTest.`creates a shipment in CREATED status` (default 1) |\n| POST /shipments allocation check | ShipmentControllerTest.`rejects shipment creation when quantity exceeds order quantity`; OrderFulfilmentTest.`rejected when shipment quantity exceeds remaining order quantity` |\n| Shipment transitions | ShipmentControllerTest.`transitions shipment from CREATED to CONFIRMED`; ShipmentControllerTest.`transitions shipment from CONFIRMED to DELIVERED`; ShipmentControllerTest.`transitions shipment from CREATED to CANCELLED`; ShipmentControllerTest.`rejects invalid state transitions with 409` |\n| Cancelled shipment releases quantity | OrderFulfilmentTest.`cancelled shipment releases its quantity`; ShipmentControllerTest.`allows new shipment after cancelled shipment releases quantity` |\n| GET /customers pagination | CustomerControllerTest.`lists customers with pagination`; CustomerControllerTest.`rejects invalid limit with 400`; CustomerControllerTest.`rejects negative offset with 400` |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} error envelope | CustomerControllerTest.`returns 404 with error envelope for an unknown customer` |\n\n---\n\n## Rows Uncovered\n\n**Row with no exercising test:**\n\n| Read Path |\n|-----------|\n| GET /shipments pagination |\n\n**Explanation:** The ShipmentController implementation includes pagination with limit/offse